description:
Design a logic circuit that combines an OR gate and an AND gate. The circuit takes two inputs, A1 and A2, which are fed into the OR gate to produce an intermediate output. This intermediate output is then ANDed with the inverse of a third input, B1, to generate the final output X. Thus, the output X will be true when either A1 or A2 is true and B1 is false.
